SUMMARY:CUUPS Samhain Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join Blue Ridge Spirit CUUPS to celebrate Samhain! \n– Set Up: 4-5 PM\n– Event Time (Ceremony/Celebration): 5-7:30 PM\n– Clean Up: 7:30-8 PM \nSamhain (All Hallows) – Pagan/Wiccan\nSamhain today marks the end of the harvest\, the start of the Pagan/Wiccan New Year\, and the honoring of our ancestors and the dead. Samhain celebrations include lighting candles\, setting up altars\, and modern activities like costume parties\, trick-or-treating\, and jack-o’-lanterns. (from https://orsl.usc.edu/life/pagan-wicca-holy-days-calendar/) \n\nFor more information on CUUPS events contact Susan Foster or Sherry Lundquist.
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/cuups-samhain-celebration-2026/
LOCATION:1 Sanctuary and Sandburg Hall\, 1 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:*Faith Formation - LEARNING,*Social Groups - LOVING
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Blue-Ridge-Spirit-CUUPS-Celebration-Generic-with-Wheel-of-the-Year.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Sherry Lundquist":MAILTO:sherry_lundquist@yahoo.com
END:VEVENT
